<title>USA: K&amp;G Men's sees Q3 shr $0.14 vs $0.12.</title>
<headline>K&amp;G Men's sees Q3 shr $0.14 vs $0.12.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>K&amp;G Men's Center Inc on Wednesday said it saw third quarter 1996 net income at about $869,000, or $0.14 per share, compared to $631,000, or $0.12 per share), a 37.7% increase.</p>
<p>The third quarter for the retail clothing concern, ended October 27.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
